# Source constraint for astroai-lab, consumed by `make lock-astroai-lab`.
#
# Unpinned on purpose: the container TAG is the user-facing version, so the
# image bakes whatever `main` is at lock time (regenerate with
# `make lock-astroai-lab` — never edit the lockfile by hand). The `v0.1.0`
# tag still declares the legacy `name = "canfar-lab"` metadata; the rename to
# `name = "astroai-lab"` happened post-v0.1.0 (commit 5f269b7 onward).
# NOTE: because this is unpinned, `make lock-check` re-resolves `main` HEAD,
# so lock drift is now automatic on every upstream push — CI fails with
# "lockfile drift" until `make lock-astroai-lab` + commit (expected workflow).
astroai-lab @ git+https://github.com/astroai/canfar-lab.git
